  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is a pretty big bug. I hadn't noticed at first until a while later while I was wondering why audiolink wasn't working on my avatar.\n\nIf you migrate a project to VCC, and you have a folder anywhere (even nested) called \"audiolink\" then the VCC deletes it with no warning.\n\nI had a folder in /Assets/Chimera/Materials/Base/audiolink and it got completely deleted by the VCC migration.\n\nI assume this has something to do with migrating versions of the audiolink package to the VCC version, but there is no reason why it should delete nested folders like that.",
